# redshift_debug_grant (Data Source)

Checks whether a global identity, an Identity Center group, or the administrators of an account hold `DEBUG` on one
database in a warehouse with federated permissions, as `SHOW GRANTS` reports it. See AWS
[GRANT DEBUG](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_GRANT.html#grant-debug-syntax) and
[SHOW GRANTS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SHOW_GRANTS.html).

## Catalog Query

```sql
SHOW GRANTS ON DATABASE database;
```

